### Auth: signup / me / logout / login
###
### Cookie session via Vite proxy. Run with make dev.
### REST Client remembers Set-Cookie (koi_session) for later requests.
### After signup, check Response Headers for Set-Cookie, or run "echo cookie".
### Re-run signup with a new email (guid) or you get 409.

### Variables
@host = http://localhost:5173
@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1
@email = rest-{{$guid}}@example.com
@password = password1

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### --- Errors (no session needed) ----------------------------------------

### Invalid JSON — 400 { "error": { "code": "invalid_json" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

not-json

### Short password — 400 { "error": { "code": "validation", "fields": [{ "field": "password", "code": "min_length" }] } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "short@example.com",
    "password": "short"
}

### Bad email — 400 { "error": { "code": "validation", "fields": [{ "field": "email", "code": "invalid" }] } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Unknown email login — 401 { "error": { "code": "invalid_credentials" } } (same as bad password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nobody@example.com",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### me without cookie — 401 { "error": { "code": "unauthorized" } }
### Run this before signup, or after logout.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### --- Session -----------------------------------------------------------

### Sign up — 201. Response Headers should include Set-Cookie: koi_session=...
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Echo cookie — request header repeats signup's Set-Cookie (health ignores it)
GET {{host}}/health
X-Debug-Set-Cookie: {{signup.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### me with cookie — 200, same email, org name = local-part
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Duplicate email — 409 { "error": { "code": "email_taken", "fields": [{ "field": "email", "code": "taken" }] } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{signup.response.body.email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Logout — 204, cookie expired
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### me after logout — 401 { "error": { "code": "unauthorized" } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Login — 200 + Set-Cookie
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{signup.response.body.email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### me after login — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Bad password — 401 { "error": { "code": "invalid_credentials" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{signup.response.body.email}}",
    "password": "wrongpass"
}
